 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## AI agent form tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up pages expose `sign-in` and `sign-up` tools using
+[declarative WebMCP](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api).
+In a browser with declarative WebMCP enabled, agents can discover the forms and
+fill their required `username` and `password` parameters. Submission stays under
+user control; neither account form enables `toolautosubmit`.
+
+Both tools use the existing client-side API requests and return the same success
+or failure message shown in the UI, without returning passwords or tokens.
+Browsers without WebMCP support continue to use the forms normally.
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
